  "note": {
    "title": "桌游系统四要素，系统的开放与封闭……",
    "desc": "这期视频将带领大家用系统的视角来看待游戏，了解在规则、体验和文化三个层面中系统的四要素。以及系统的开放与封闭。浅谈限制对游戏设计的意义。这期视频有点难理解，觉得干的话可以多喝两口水。\n引用与拓展阅读：\n1.MIT Press《Rules of Play: Game Design Fundamentals》\n2. Eric Zimmerman《Game Design as a Model for Literacy in the Twenty-First Century》\n3. International Journal of Design (Norman 1988, p.158)\n4. Mark Rosewater《Ten Things Every Game Needs》Part 1（2011）\n5. Mark Rosewater GDC 2016《Twenty Years, Twenty Lessons》Part 3\n6. Reiner Knizia 访谈https://leftlion.co.uk/features/2016/11/german-board-game-designer-reiner-knizia-visited-ludorati-cafe/ https://www.beastsofwar.com/board-games/behind-the-board-games-reiner-knizia/ https://andhegames.com/how-reiner-knizia-makes-games/\n7. Frontiers in Psychology — https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fpsyg.2022.924953/pdf\n8. Donald Norman《设计心理学》\n9. 《Why Does White Always Go First in Chess?》\n#桌面游戏[话题]# #桌游[话题]# #桌游设计[话题]# #游戏设计[话题]# #国际象棋[话题]#",
